WEBVTT

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.430
We'll finish things with no gloves.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.690
Are you ready?

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:52.270
Wait Dad, that's silly.

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:55.690
You haven't seen your son in so long,
yet you want a fight?

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:58.200
It's because we're father and son.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.200
Five years ago, I had a shameful defeat.

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:07.290
<i>In my entire career, my first ten-count</i>
<i>was at the hands of my own son.</i>

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:11.710
You were still an inexperienced teen.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.920
You're being unreasonable.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.720
You were already past 50 at the time.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:22.220
Age doesn't matter
when people exchange punches.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:25.470
That's even more true with father and son.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:28.980
It just means
I was neglecting my training.

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:32.900
So does that mean you've been training?

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.320
It had been a while since I last trained.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:43.240
<i>There were two-kilo work boots collecting</i>
<i>dust in the back of the storehouse.</i>

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.080
<i>Rather than roadwork, I had to roadwalk.</i>

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.080
<i>I had to start from walking.</i>

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:55.500
<i>It took three months, an entire season,</i>
<i>to start running.</i>

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.510
<i>The sandbag,</i>

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.760
<i>punching ball,</i>

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.010
<i>and jump rope...</i>

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:06.220
<i>I finally sparred</i>
<i>with experienced partners</i>

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:11.520
<i>after 18 months, or a year and a half,</i>
<i>since I started walking.</i>

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.980
You're even sparring now?

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:18.780
It took nine times longer than
when I was active though.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.820
What a long time.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.530
But, Dad.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:29.120
Unfortunately, I'm not in good condition.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.050
It is indeed unfortunate, that my son...

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.050
is this much of a chicken.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.760
You're afraid of an old man

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:49.060
who is in his 60's, and has been
diagnosed with many illnesses.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.390
What is martial arts?

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.230
<i>It doesn't matter who, when, or where.</i>

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.860
That's what martial arts is in Japan.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:04.700
Wasn't that what you were striving for?

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:09.080
Yet you have the nerve to
talk about your condition.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.700
How shameful!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.210
Go back to your room.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:21.210
I didn't waste these past five years
to fight with a chicken.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.970
Leave!

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.970
Please, wait.

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:28.550
I'll do it.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:32.850
I'll fight you right here.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.730
Is that so?

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:39.770
Don't call me a chicken.

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:43.740
How rare of you to say such a manly thing.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.740
<i>Don't call me a chicken.</i>

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>Don't say it.</i>

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:54.580
<i>I won't let you ever call me a chicken!</i>

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.680
<i>The finest soup made by a first-rate chef</i>

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.930
<i>is said to be eloquent.</i>

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:16.020
<i>With one spoonful, you can picture</i>
<i>the abundant ingredients in a big pot.</i>

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.530
<i>How eloquent.</i>

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.030
<i>What an eloquent punch that was.</i>

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.780
<i>His supposedly elderly father</i>

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:33.540
<i>had such a cruel, rigorous five years.</i>

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:38.290
<i>His punch tells a story</i>
<i>of how much he has sweat,</i>

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.880
<i>and that single blow</i>
<i>more than makes up for his troubles.</i>

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.550
Amazing.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:48.050
Dad, you're amazing.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.050
With that one punch, I truly understand.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.310
It's not complete though.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:57.560
I'm still far from fighting 15 rounds.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.810
But...

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:03.020
this is more than enough to educate you.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:36.350
<i>I should be faster.</i>

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:44.610
<i>I should be stronger.</i>

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.200
<i>I should be better at everything.</i>

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.580
You're too young, too slow.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.920
And you're astonishingly weak.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:09.630
It's over.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.510
Carry him to my room.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.640
Yes, sir.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.160
What are you thinking?

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.660
Do you hate it now?

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:39.700
You lost four fights in a row.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.660
It's understandable.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.670
So you know after all.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:50.630
The man who controls the underground
fighting world in this country

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.680
is a big fan of mine.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.510
He told me that three big names

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:59.180
in the underground scene
gave you a thorough beating.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.310
<i>Jack Hanma.</i>

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.310
<i>Doppo Orochi.</i>

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:04.900
<i>Goki Shibukawa.</i>

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.900
I heard it was those three
troubling people.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:13.950
I'm surprised you knew so much,
yet you challenged me to a fight.

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:16.950
I couldn't let you win.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.450
The man I was chasing for five years
was at death's door,

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:24.790
and both his hands and feet
were completely destroyed.

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:28.040
Of course I would challenge him.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.760
I bet when I accepted your challenge,

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:37.470
you had your back turned
with that same smile.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.800
What?

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:41.970
Are you whining?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.350
Whining?

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.060
Can't I?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:52.030
How about you give up already?

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.030
You did well.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:03.500
You took the all-compatible boxing
that I strived for and evolved it.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.040
I'm thankful.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:09.420
But this is a world
where we decide who's on top.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.050
I want to free my son from such a world.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:16.880
That's my earnest desire as your father.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:29.310
I'm younger, faster, and more powerful.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:33.400
But I wasn't stronger.

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.450
Which is stronger?

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:43.290
It's such a simple topic,
yet it has immeasurable depth.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.870
<i>Sea Emperor Kaku is almost 150 years old.</i>

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.920
<i>Doppo Orochi isn't as old</i>
<i>but still considered old.</i>

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:52.630
<i>There's Goki Shibukawa, too.</i>

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.840
None of them plan to
step down from this game.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:02.310
And, even if your opponent
is your own son,

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.520
you will win at any cost.

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:08.310
That's how enchanting this game is.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.310
You...

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:12.270
I lost four times in a row.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.320
But I won't give up.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.150
I can't give up anymore.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:21.070
Wow, Mister!

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:24.660
What an impressive warrior.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:28.080
I told you earlier about my fan, right?

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.080
Being the strongest means being the best.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:32.960
It's even worth your life.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.920
You can't even shake hands like that.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:41.180
There's the world's strongest man,
who could win a Nobel prize for strength.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.800
Do you want to fight Baki Hanma?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.440
The Strongest Boy on Earth, Hanma Baki.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:53.860
Do you have the courage
to fight with that monster?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.650
No. Sorry, Mr. Tokugawa.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:00.360
Unfortunately, this man doesn't have
that kind of courage.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.870
He'll probably make
a half-assed excuse and reject you.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:08.040
Make sure you make a reasonable,

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.460
indisputable, and clever excuse.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:14.840
You can make countless reasons
for avoiding a fight,

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:18.880
like injury, fever, or unfortunate timing.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.430
Dad, that's slightly wrong.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:26.890
Oh, what part of it was slightly wrong?

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.640
I don't want to enter a fight recklessly,

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.850
but I don't want to lie with an excuse.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:37.400
Mr. Tokugawa came all this way,
so I'd like to at least

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.980
treat him with sincerity.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.160
I'd like to be sincere, at least.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.540
I know that this position in Japan

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.000
is the highest level of sincerity.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.420
And then, you do this.

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:07.560
Mr. Tokugawa, you have expectations
for someone like me.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:10.680
And in response,

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.270
I'll do my very best!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.690
That is what my father taught me.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.030
Mr. Mohammad Alai Jr.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.620
You are a warrior.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.790
Please raise your head.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:42.210
I wholeheartedly accept
your honesty and sincerity.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.470
It seems to have been decided.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.430
You're right.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:52.480
Looks like my prediction
was slightly wrong.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.440
<i>Only slightly.</i>

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.940
MITSUNARI TOKUGAWA

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.230
So what did Baki say?

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.950
He accepted.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.200
And he'll fight with all his might.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.870
-He accepted?
-Yes.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.700
He said it's only natural as a champion.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:17.000
-He didn't raise any objections?
-No.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.960
It went incredibly smoothly.

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:45.240
Sir, are you sure you're not overdoing it?

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.740
What kind of world is this?

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.490
What world would put this man
in such trouble?

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:06.340
<i>How many hours</i>

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.760
<i>has he been at it?</i>

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.010
How long

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:12.970
has he been doing that?

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.770
Who are you?

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.140
We don't allow outsiders.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:18.890
Take off the sunglasses.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.520
Are you satisfied now?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.190
I was mistaken.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.240
Someone like you would need sunglasses.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:34.160
You're more famous than
the American president.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.870
You can't walk around with your face out.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.670
Can I really stay here?

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.500
All fighters think of you like a god.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:46.840
In fact, I should be asking
if I'm allowed to be in your presence.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:51.140
You may relax, Absolute Champion.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.310
I'm honored, Champ.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.560
Recklessly, with no purpose,

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.320
and with no future.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.650
How does it feel
hitting the bag like that?

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:20.580
If you can't think up a plan,
start off by attacking.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.590
Those are words that I gave to you.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:31.220
It seems you spent more than
half a day doing this.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.100
It goes against science.

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.850
But that's fine.

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:42.100
Regardless of what modern medicine says,

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:47.980
<i>add more burden to the injured areas</i>
<i>and make your flesh do the work.</i>

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:51.360
<i>Old-school martial arts have</i>
<i>several real examples of this.</i>

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.870
That's how much power the body has.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.620
Baki Hanma has accepted your challenge.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.000
However...

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:08.000
only if you're at your best condition.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:10.760
What?

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.760
"Come to the fighting ring
in your best condition.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.640
Then I'll be your opponent."

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:21.640
Those are Baki Hanma's words.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:23.640
The sounds...

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.170
Isn't the body amazing?

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.770
Who might you be?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:09.190
I'm going through.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:23.120
I came to save you.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.960
You seem pale.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.330
Mr. Alai.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:31.460
We were about to run and leave you behind.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:34.170
You would never be able to escape.

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:42.640
Wow, you look astoundingly young.

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.680
Thirty years ago,

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:49.730
I came to Tokyo to fight Igari,
a pro wrestler.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.650
<i>You're just as I remember.</i>

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:56.490
How's Junior's condition?

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.870
Champion Baki Hanma.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:05.500
What kind of fighter is he?

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:11.380
He's not perfect, but he has my blood.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.130
Body function, willpower, and experience.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:19.090
He'd surpass an Olympic athlete
at any one of these qualities.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.600
You could say...

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:25.520
he's one of
the strongest people in the world.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.810
That's what I wanted.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.780
Have your injuries healed?

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:40.660
I'm not at my best,
but I've basically recovered.

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.370
It's thanks to you

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.290
and your boyfriend.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.290
You always say

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:50.670
half-assed comments like that.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.880
"Half-assed"?

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.340
I didn't help you at all.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.050
You're making half-assed comments too.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.350
What about me is half-assed?

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:07.310
You're not listening to my words.

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:10.810
You think that I'm
an irresponsible playboy.

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:12.810
You are though.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:21.450
The power people have when they set a goal

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.910
is such an incredible thing.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:29.000
<i>Sometimes, even going to the bathroom</i>
<i>can be a bother.</i>

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:32.880
<i>But if it's for vacation,</i>
<i>those same people</i>

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:35.460
<i>can travel thousands of miles abroad.</i>

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:38.460
<i>He's right.</i>

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.220
It's a huge difference.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.510
<i>The bathroom is meters away,</i>

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.720
<i>and the resort is thousands of miles away.</i>

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.480
When I think about you and Baki,

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.350
my body gets
closer to recovery on its own.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.730
Are you going to fight?

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.860
It's because I despise him.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.700
Why?

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:08.620
Baki Hanma has you and his title
as the strongest in the world.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:11.870
-That's--
-They're both things I want.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:16.880
To get these two things,
he's a wall I must overcome.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.880
He's really strong.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:21.380
I know.

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.880
Neither goal is easy.

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:27.390
Not you, nor the title.

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.390
MITSUNARI TOKUGAWA

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.600
You've never fought them before,
so this may be a hard question.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.060
Alai Jr. versus Baki.

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.900
Which would you bet on?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.400
I've only fought Junior's father before.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.160
On that day 30 years ago,

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:52.540
<i>that guy's boxing style</i>
<i>already had the basics down.</i>

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.670
<i>You mean during</i>
<i>the dullest game of the century?</i>

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.290
That hurts.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:00.750
I thought it would work out
if I could grapple him.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.170
I believed that for 45 minutes.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.430
I couldn't do anything in the end.

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.430
-It was his mental imaging.
-Imaging?

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:15.640
<i>As soon as I entered his space,</i>
<i>no matter how I tackled,</i>

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:17.810
<i>he'd knock me down right there.</i>

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:20.650
That wasn't boxing.

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:24.190
<i>It was truly all-encompassing.</i>

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:26.700
Thirty years have passed.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.450
I'm sure it's grown

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.200
into something troublesome.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:32.200
And so?

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:36.540
Alai Jr. will definitely win.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.210
I see.

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.670
That's what you think?

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:47.760
Yes, I think Alai Jr. will win.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.720
What is your reasoning?

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.220
It goes without saying,
but it's because of us.

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:58.020
Most likely, on the day of the fight,

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:00.480
right in the middle of it...

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:03.480
Alai Jr. will be complete.

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:09.280
We're on the same page.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.000
Right in front of you,

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:20.420
I will defeat Baki Hanma.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG
